@@section 1
@@title SQ-SPF Creative split feature regression: every Creative jar's features after the split, 2026-11-06 ([creative_split.md](../creative_split.md) 7.18, TODO `creativesplit/regression #14`)
@@date 2026-11-06
@@jars creativebrewing creativecommon creativedelight creativedevtools creativeengineering creativemagic
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_split.md
@@text
@@text Not run. Targets the builds of 2026-11-06 18:51-18:54 (Common 1.1.0, Compat, Calendar, Magic, Equipment, Engineering
@@text 2.0.0, Worldgen, Delight 1.1.0, Brewing 1.0.0; `prep_srv.sh` swaps them in), Devtools `creativedevtools-1.0.0` of 2026-11-05
@@text 22:09, Creative Labels 1.0.1 of 2026-11-04 21:53. None of the 18:5x builds is in `mods/` (installed jars are 2026-11-05 22:09 and
@@text 2026-11-06 01:30). The carve rows (SQ-CEN, SQ-CMG / SQ-CEQ, SQ-CSN, SQ-DEP, SQ-ENGM, SQ-CBP) check that each jar boots and
@@text carries its config; this section checks that the **features** still work, one jar at a time, against a baseline from
@@text the jars installed today. Rows named "RERUN" are earlier feature rows to run unchanged on these jars (their ids, config
@@text file and namespace may need the split reading: a table that was in `creativeengineering-common.toml` is now in the
@@text owning jar's file, see each jar's writeup section 1).
@@text
@@text **Run plan.** (r1106spf: the installed jars stopped booting with the current `kubejs/` tree, so the baseline is the instance's `kubejs/exported/` dumps and `tools/scratch_query/batches/r1106spf/compare.py`; perfBot bots do not survive a restart: `pbot spawn` again at the top of every boot.) Boot 0 (baseline): group A on the jars in `mods/` (`NOSWAP=1`), `/dumpall`, keep `kubejs/exported/` as
@@text `RES/base/`, build the fixture world below, `/save-all`, stop. Boot 1: same save, the 18:5x builds, `/dumpall` again to
@@text `RES/new/`; run every A row. Boot 2: group B fresh normal world (seed 8675309) for the Worldgen rows. Boot 3: B-nether
@@text not needed. Client block last (pinned owner note: split client rows run as one bulk client session). A perfBot player
@@text (`bot`) is needed for every row that says "bot".
@@text
@@text **Fixture world (boot 0, superflat, near 0 0):** a 3 x 3 patch of moss next to grass (moss tint), a vine on a wall,
@@text a `quark:monster_box`, a leaf pile of 5 layers, a chest holding a tier shield, a skinned backpack, a stepstool, a
@@text wooden water bucket, a precision sawblade, a Trinket Case, a Vinery wine bottle with an age tag, a Brewin' keg with a
@@text brewing recipe started, a Farmer's Delight cooking pot with a meal in progress, a sticky note and a label on the chest
@@text face; an IE sawmill fed with logs; a dragon head behind a Create encased fan; a lit campfire under open sky; a farmland
@@text row of wheat and an out-of-season crop (a Vintage or Veggies crop whose season is not the current one).
@@text
@@table
## SQ-SPF-00 | boot on the 18:5x builds: jars, mixin and class errors, script errors
@group A
@commands Boot 1: mod list; `grep -cE "Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|NoClassDefFoundError\|ClassNotFoundException" logs/latest.log`; `grep -E "Error occurred while handling event\|ReferenceError\|global\.(CEN\|CMG\|CEQ\|CWG\|CDV) missing" logs/kubejs/*.log \| head`; `python3 tools/scratch_query/tag_diff.py RES/base RES/new` (item, block, fluid tags) and diff of the registry and recipe id lists
@pass boot reaches `Done (`; all 11 Creative jars plus Labels and Exposure listed; 0 mixin / class errors naming `com.SaintAlfonzo` or `ce.shared`; no script error; item, block and fluid ids identical to the baseline; recipe ids identical except the documented namespace moves (`creativemagic:`, `creativeequipment:`, `creativedelight:`, `creativedevtools:`); tag membership identical except rows a changelog bullet names
@fails the first id or tag that differs names the jar; a script that did not run (its startup pack missing in startup.log); a `// requires:` guard skipping a whole file
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
> pbot spawn qa -20 -60 -24 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|InvalidInjectionException|NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException).*(com\.SaintAlfonzo|ce\.shared)
kjsreject Error occurred while handling event
kjsreject ReferenceError
kjsreject global\.(CEN|CMG|CEQ|CWG|CDV) (missing|is undefined)
shell ls mods | grep -iE "^creative|exposure" ; grep -ciE "Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException" logs/latest.log; grep -hE "Error occurred while handling event|ReferenceError" logs/kubejs/*.log | head
look 11 Creative jars (Common, Compat, Calendar, Devtools, Magic, Equipment, Engineering, Worldgen, Delight, Brewing, Labels) plus Exposure; tag/registry/recipe diff is done offline by compare.py

